    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover the dark secrets of Yalroc Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're a young, inexperienced recruit to the Canihuel Empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why has the power-hungry Empress Keranna sent you on a mission to the seemingly peaceful Yalroc Island? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is it because of rumors of the presence of a legendary military artifact of devastating power, or does the Empire have other plans for you? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore, solve, fight </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Antediluvial: Yalroc Island</strong> is a game inspired by the classic ARPGs of the 90s. Explore gloomy dungeons and solve puzzles, fight a variety of enemies, demonstrate your skills in platforming phases and explore the island to discover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643840/extras/fce67cfc90d06596a648fd4b7fede273.poster.avif?t=1738851680\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643840/extras/fce67cfc90d06596a648fd4b7fede273.webm?t=1738851680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643840/extras/fce67cfc90d06596a648fd4b7fede273.mp4?t=1738851680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A game based on a time loop: three days to survive the flood </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Antediluvial: Yalroc Island</strong>, each cycle begins with the same initial state, but depending on your actions and discoveries, it will be different from the previous one. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If things go wrong, you can always restart a cycle at any time. You'll keep the equipment, island knowledge and items you've accumulated over the course of your adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643840/extras/8e2feba1172df5aa517e305fbbe3a60a.poster.avif?t=1738851680\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643840/extras/8e2feba1172df5aa517e305fbbe3a60a.webm?t=1738851680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1643840/extras/8e2feba1172df5aa517e305fbbe3a60a.mp4?t=1738851680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
